,1924,2021,1982,1953,1748,1748,1649,1689,1599,1490,1540,1480,1330],"v":[90434,669512,580558,203449,421524,450038,119901,68026,102542,758085,470485,185984,141407,431894,91430,100035,159537,139714,1242363,1230394,538475,237235,454160,119181,141852,233063,262960,597989,750061,134766,64509,289193,596840,342953,390184,552034,242793,26683511,91426140,94582600,99296000,302909680,222183040,168143540,185822420,77343700,28631200,50011560,83772420,24867040,75455120,53362640,21987860,21998020,21052100,9446880,9608460,10036780,43580480,18448940,7776280,12202360,22903660,11556360,5467700,14061840,9719340,6825960,15826660,23914720,36440740,93224940,101635680,82003580,66742680,133588820,26610060,21111720,14354760,16958580,44057540,137049800,101809160,30779200,55312700,101604100,27924600,92656900,72535500,78836600,106300100,42625600,58731500,45202700,13172800,9762300,12464200,3392700,9783100,3900700,5078400,9658400,2939600,17816700,70180400,66853400,67094800,46968900,18428400,27530000,10946400,29805100,23388500,23398600,15563200,13994900,17517200,5511900,1678900,2060700]}},"profile":{"website":"https://lianson.com","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Equipment & Services","employees":313,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Lianson Fleet Group Berhad, an investment holding company, provides vessel chartering, ship management, and offshore marine services to the oil and gas related industries in Malaysia, Singapore, Vietnam and Brunei. The company offers in-field support that offers ample deck space and offshore construction activities. It also provides anchor handling and towing functions; and serves as a safety standby rescue and firefighting vessels for oil spill response and recovery efforts. In addition, the company operates various types of vessels, including anchor handling tug and supply, accommodation workboat, straight supply, and platform supply vessels, as well as tugs and barges, and dry bulk carriers. Further, it owns, leases, and operates vessels; and offers well services. The company was formerly known as Icon Offshore Berhad and changed its name to Lianson Fleet Group Berhad in January 2025. The company was founded in 1994 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Lianson Fleet Group Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，为马来西亚、新加坡、越南和文莱的油气相关行业提供船舶租赁、船舶管理和海上海事服务。公司成立于1994年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，前身为 Icon Offshore Berhad，于2025年1月更名为现名。","lines":["船舶租赁与运营：拥有、租赁和运营多种类型船舶，包括锚作拖轮供应船、住宿工作船、直线供应船、平台供应船、拖船和驳船以及干散货船，服务于油气行业客户。","海上海事服务：提供现场支持（包括甲板空间和海上施工活动）、锚作与拖曳功能，以及作为安全待命救援和消防船用于溢油响应与回收工作。","船舶管理：为油气相关行业提供船舶管理服务。","油井服务：提供油井相关服务。"],"lines_en":["Vessel Chartering & Operation: Owns, leases, and operates various vessel types including anchor handling tug and supply, accommodation workboat, straight supply, platform supply vessels, tugs and barges, and dry bulk carriers for oil and gas industry customers.","Offshore Marine Services: Provides in-field support with deck space and offshore construction activities, anchor handling and towing functions, and serves as safety standby rescue and firefighting vessels for oil spill response and recovery efforts.","Ship Management: Offers ship management services to oil and gas related industries.","Well Services: Provides well services."]}}